\paragraph{Matched framing control.}
The inline-slot and span-CSRT comparison uses the same verified spans and eligible
items, while changing the reconstruction instruction and output format. The paired
gated difference is 0.300 at $k=1$ and 0.105 at $k=2$; at $k=3$ the stored difference
